    {
      "chunkId": "rag-59e0dbed25-c0",
      "docId": "rag-59e0dbed25",
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "chunkIndex": 0,
      "text": "Causal Technical Indicators & Regime Engine Documentation:\n1. Session VWAP: Resets strictly at 09:15 IST each trading day using cumulative typical price ((H+L+C)/3) * volume divided by cumulative volume. Prevents multi-day leakage.\n2. Wilder RSI(14) & ADX(14): Computed strictly causally using Wilder's smoothed moving averages. ADX > 25 indicates directional trend strength; ADX < 18 indicates sideways/choppy range.\n3. Opening Range Breakout (ORB 15m): Captures high and low of the first 15 minutes of each NSE session (09:15–09:30 IST).\n4. Supertrend (ATR 10, Multiplier 3): Causal trailing volatility trend band.\n5.",
